(6577986, 979593, 103142, '<td valign="top">The topic of mounting drawers isn''t that interesting, and I''m not sure about the wide angle and how it skews the right and the left so much.<br/> <br/>That being said -- the one exposure is impressive and the tones of the shot are truly wonderful. I find myself not particularly caring what it is that you''re doing -- but simply enjoying the lighting and the tones. 8</td>', 'The topic of mounting drawers isn''t that interesting, and I''m not sure about the wide angle and how it skews the right and the left so much. That being said -- the one exposure is impressive and the tones of the shot are truly wonderful. I find myself not particularly caring what it is that you''re doing -- but simply enjoying the lighting and the tones. 8', '2011-10-28 00:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577987, 979429, 103142, '<td valign="top">I thought about a cooking step by step, but I didn''t think it would be that interesting. But this one is really making my mouth water! I wish the bread was a little more prominent in the final picture, but it makes absolutely no difference in the score -- I just want the bread!  8</td>', 'I thought about a cooking step by step, but I didn''t think it would be that interesting. But this one is really making my mouth water! I wish the bread was a little more prominent in the final picture, but it makes absolutely no difference in the score -- I just want the bread!  8', '2011-10-28 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
