(6577995, 979585, 103142, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have thought that knot tying would have made an interesting picture -- but I quite like this! Small thing: I''m wondering if it would be better if the white letters were the color of the rope instead of white. They stick out a little much. Doesn''t change the score -- just a thought. :) 7</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought that knot tying would have made an interesting picture -- but I quite like this! Small thing: I''m wondering if it would be better if the white letters were the color of the rope instead of white. They stick out a little much. Doesn''t change the score -- just a thought. :) 7', '2011-10-28 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
