(6578097, 979585, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was very clear and instructive.  And now I see there''s a story to go with it.  Thoughts and prayers for your friends'' son.</td>', 'I thought this was very clear and instructive.  And now I see there''s a story to go with it.  Thoughts and prayers for your friends'' son.', '2011-10-28 01:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
