(6578680, 979581, 43463, '<td valign="top">Hey there Alicia! Congrats on the fantastic job and earning 4th place! Lighting, mood, story and model are all great in this composition! Can''t make out what the label is on the wine bottle - wonder if I switch from a bottle of Relax to try this;-P Just noticed this - love how you have the first frame so tight and small as she uncorks the wine and drinks the frames get larger as she unwinds. Another little visual cue of being able to stretch out and relax.</td>', 'Hey there Alicia! Congrats on the fantastic job and earning 4th place! Lighting, mood, story and model are all great in this composition! Can''t make out what the label is on the wine bottle - wonder if I switch from a bottle of Relax to try this;-P Just noticed this - love how you have the first frame so tight and small as she uncorks the wine and drinks the frames get larger as she unwinds. Another little visual cue of being able to stretch out and relax.', '2011-10-29 00:07:47.000000', NULL, 0),
